  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1802.16 “Gross vehicle weight rating (GVWR)” means “gross vehicle weight rating or GVWR” as defined in RSA 259:38-b.\n\nSource. #8405, eff 8-2-05 (formerly Saf-C 1801.16); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24\n\nNew. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34",
